## Tailwind 类名规范

### 按钮

```html
<!-- 主按钮 -->
<button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-md px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 disabled:opacity-50 transition-colors">

<!-- 次要按钮 -->
<button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 rounded-md px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">

<!-- 幽灵按钮 -->
<button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-md px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors">

<!-- 危险按钮 -->
<button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-red-600 text-white rounded-md px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-red-700 transition-colors">

<!-- 图标按钮 -->
<button class="p-2 rounded-md text-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700 transition-colors">
```

### 输入框

```html
<input class="w-full h-9 px-3 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-md bg-white placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-slate-900/10 focus:border-slate-300 transition-colors">
```

### 卡片

```html
<div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
    <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50">
        <!-- 卡片标题 -->
    </div>
    <div class="p-4">
        <!-- 卡片内容 -->
    </div>
</div>
```

### 表格

```html
<!-- 表格容器 -->
<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
    <table class="w-full">
        <!-- 表头 -->
        <thead>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">列头</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <!-- 数据行 -->
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            <tr class="group hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
                <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-700">内容</td>
                <!-- 数值列 -->
                <td class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-right font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-700">123.45</td>
                <!-- 操作列 -->
                <td class="px-4 py-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                        <button class="opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 p-1.5 rounded-md text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all">
                            <i class="bi bi-eye"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
```

### 分页

```html
<nav class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
    <span class="text-sm text-slate-500 mr-2">共 {{ total }} 条</span>
    <button class="p-2 rounded-md text-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-100 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none">
        <i class="bi bi-chevron-left"></i>
    </button>
    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium bg-slate-900 text-white rounded">1</span>
    <button class="p-2 rounded-md text-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-100">
        <i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i>
    </button>
</nav>
```

